---
description: Apply when editing Stripe, Polar, or payment webhook handlers
globs:
  - "**/*webhook*"
  - "**/*stripe*"
  - "**/*polar*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before editing these files, read `.viberaven/agent-context.md` and `.viberaven/mission-map.md`.

A payment webhook handler should verify the provider signature over the raw request body before trusting the event. After webhook edits, `npx -y viberaven@1.6.3 check` shows whether a Stripe handler does.